{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"司馬遷作史記，敘四裔於篇末。秦、漢以降，各有其國，彼疆此界，道里云邈。不能混","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"一寰宇，周知種落，鄰國聘貢往來，焉能歷覽。或口傳意記，模寫梗概耳。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"遼接五代，漢地遠近，載諸簡冊可考。西北沙漠之地，樹藝五穀，衣服車馬禮文，制度","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"文為，土產品物，得其粗而失其精。部落之名，姓氏之號，得其音而未得其字。歷代踵","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"訛，艱於考索。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"遼氏與諸部相通，往來朝貢，及西遼所至之地，見於紀、傳亦豈少也哉。其事則書於紀，部族則列於表云。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"紀年","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"正月","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"二月","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"三月","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"四月","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"五月","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"六月","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"七月","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"八月","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"九月","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"十月","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_18","