,"chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"征烏古部。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"六年","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"皇太子暨諸將分擊部落，以烏古、奚為圖盧、涅離、奧畏三部。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"天贊元年","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"擊西南諸部。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"分迭剌部為二院。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"二年","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"討奚胡損，獲之，置奚墮瑰部。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"三年","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"擊山東部族，破之。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"破胡母思山蕃部。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"天顯元年","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"奚部長勃魯恩、王郁從征有功，賞之。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"安邊、鄚頡、定理三府叛，討之。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"三年太宗不改元","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"突呂不討烏古部。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"突呂不獻烏古俘。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_69_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_69","textTraditional":"鼻骨德來貢。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su